# ================================================== live business data
# Partner records carry contact names, emails, phones, addresses, fees
# and signers. They are NOT source code and must never reach a repo --
# private or otherwise. store.py already keeps its own snapshot history
# for these (store.history / store.restore), so they are not unprotected.
partners/
partners_backup_*/
leads/
product_runs/
cache/

# ============================================== generated + heavy files
# 81M of generated agreements and kits, 78M of partner logos and art.
output/
assets/

